## Minimal AST you would need

Something like:

```go
type Program struct {
    Decls []Decl
}

type Decl interface {
    declNode()
}

type TypeDecl struct {
    Name string
}

type RelDecl struct {
    Name   string
    Params []Param
}

type FnDecl struct {
    Name   string
    Params []Param
    Return TypeExpr
}

type DefDecl struct {
    Name   string
    Params []Param
    Body   Formula
}

type SpecDecl struct {
    Name   string
    Params []Param
    Result Param
    Clauses []Clause
}
```

Then formulas:

```go
type Formula interface {
    formulaNode()
}

type PredApp struct {
    Name string
    Args []Term
}

type BinaryFormula struct {
    Op    BinaryOp
    Left  Formula
    Right Formula
}

type QuantifiedFormula struct {
    Quantifier Quantifier
    Binder     Binder
    Body       Formula
}
```

And terms/types similarly.

This is all straightforward in Go.

